---
// One line of status text. CSS shows the span matching html[data-radio].
---
<span class="radio-status" role="status">
  <span data-when="idle">Tiešraides radio</span>
  <span data-when="loading">Savienojas…</span>
  <span data-when="playing"><i class="live-dot"></i>Skan tiešraidē</span>
  <span data-when="error">Neizdevās pieslēgties</span>
</span>
